  "note": "Every capability the game has a word for, read off the dispatch-order editor's own form at /aaos/new: one checkbox per flag, named aao[<flag>], because an order can say \"every vehicle that can do this\". It is the whole vocabulary, including flags no vehicle on any one account carries — which is what a requirement key is matched against. `branch` is which of the editor's own tabs the flag sits in, so it says which service the flag belongs to and NOTHING about which type carries it: the flag boxes and the type boxes are siblings on that form, never a mapping. Three entries are figures the editor filters on rather than capabilities, and are marked so.",
  "source": "the game's own /aaos/new form, via Diagnostics -> What the dispatch orders know, reported 2026-09-23",
